    {
      "id": "BOSS_COGITATOR_PRIME",
      "chapter": 6,
      "_doc": "17 §7 — the timer fight. Escalation is authored in every phase block because a phase entry deactivates the block being left: phase 1 and phase 2 each carry a +2% step every 5 s, and phase 3's Overclock carries the +4% step 17 §7 doubles it to. The STACKS are BATTLE-scoped and MULTIPLICATIVE, which is what 17 §7's 'compounding, and never resets for the whole fight' means — the accumulated multiplier survives every transition even though the periodic that grants it is re-anchored at each entry (R8). Under R1 the value IS the multiplier, so 1.02 is +2%. ⚠️ Piston Slam's 'ignores 40% DEF' is NOT authored: the DSL gives penetration only as the PEN stat, and a phase-3 PEN aura would apply to every autoattack as well, which 17 §7 does not say. Left unexpressed and recorded rather than approximated.",
